#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:63
msgid "Ansible on Windows"
msgstr "Ansible no Windows"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:65
msgid ""
"When executing Ansible playbooks on Windows platforms, a few requirements"
" must be met:"
msgstr "Ao executar playbooks Ansible em plataformas Windows, alguns requisitos devem ser atendidos:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:67
msgid ""
"``pywinrm`` may need to be installed on the |morpheus| Appliance via "
"``pip install pywinrm``"
msgstr "``pywinrm`` pode precisar ser instalado no Appliance |morpheus| via ``pip install pywinrm``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:69
msgid ""
"An Ansible Integration must be scoped to a Group or Cloud for Ansible to "
"execute on Windows, as |morpheus| assumes Ansible local when no group or "
"cloud is scoped to Ansible. The playbooks do not need to be executed "
"solely in the Group or Cloud, one just needs to be scoped to an Ansible "
"Integration for Ansible Windows to run properly."
msgstr "Uma Integração Ansible deve ser delimitada a um Grupo ou Nuvem para que o Ansible execute no Windows, pois o |morpheus| assume Ansible local quando nenhum grupo ou nuvem está delimitado ao Ansible. Os playbooks não precisam ser executados somente no Grupo ou Nuvem; basta que um deles esteja delimitado a uma Integração Ansible para que o Ansible Windows funcione corretamente."

